Description: Markdown, Typst and LaTeX editor with live preview
 meditor is a desktop and mobile editor for Markdown, Typst and LaTeX with a
 live, paginated preview, PDF export, tabs, session restore and a touch-first
 layout.
 .
 Documents stay on the device; files are opened and saved through the system
 dialogs. The LaTeX preview compiles through a configurable TeX Live endpoint.
